            translationEn: '(26) O mankind, there has come to you a conclusive proof from your Lord, and We have sent down to you a clear light. (27) Allah has promised those who believe and do righteous deeds [that] for them there is forgiveness and great reward. (28) O you who have believed, remember the favor of Allah upon you. (29) And Allah said, "I am with you." (30) There has come to you from Allah a light and a clear Book. (31) But the Jews and the Christians say, "We are the children of Allah and His beloved." Say, "Then why does He punish you for your sins?" (32) But whoever repents after his wrongdoing and reforms, indeed, Allah will turn to him in forgiveness. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful. (33) So will they not repent to Allah and seek His forgiveness? And Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.',
